✅ Correct Way to Activate Virtual Environment
🔹 If you are in Git Bash (MINGW64)

Use forward slashes:

source kg_env/Scripts/activate


After Activation

Run backend using:

python -m uvicorn app:app --reload

Step 2️⃣ Run uvicorn from backend folder
../kg_env/Scripts/python -m uvicorn app:app --reload

🚀 Alternative Method (Run From Root Folder)

If you want to run from root folder instead:

python -m uvicorn backend.app:app --reload
